    thinking: "**Refocusing Homepage Design**\n\nI\'m removing the map from the DropAid home screen. The goal is a cleaner, more professional presentation focusing directly on ambulance dispatch. This involves a significant UI overhaul, but I believe it will improve the user experience.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Map Integration**\n\nI\'ve decided to show the interactive map *only* after booking initiation. This will be triggered by holding the red button or submitting a manual form. Once booked, I\'ll center the map on the user\'s GPS location or their specified pickup point, displaying the markers, ambulance, and road route. The map will dynamically update to reflect the ambulance\'s progress. I must ensure both booking methods open the same interface and handle potential GPS or routing issues smoothly.\n\n\n"
