  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Initial Conditions**\n\nI\'ve observed that the `INITIAL_DEMO_BOOKING` object was at the `\'en_route_pickup\'` stage. Furthermore, I see the `bookings` array initially contained only this single booking. Now, I\'m trying to figure out what happens as the user makes requests.\n\n\n**Refining Map Integration**\n\nI\'m now focused on the map\'s integration. The aim is to remove the map from the homepage, keeping the focus clean. The plan is to show the map only after the booking process is initiated, whether via the hold-to-book action or manual form submission. The map will display the user\'s pickup point, destination, and the ambulance. Dynamic tracking of the ambulance\'s route and position is key. This will all have quality control measures to ensure consistency and prevent errors.\n\n\n"
