    thinking: "**Analyzing Trip Stages**\n\nI\'ve been examining the `TripStage` enum, specifically noticing the presence of \'pending\'. I\'m now thinking about how to integrate this, and other stages, into the dynamic tracking system, particularly the initial display of the pickup location and ambulance search status. The goal is to make use of different trip stages.\n\n\n"
