  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Map Behaviors**\n\nI\'m now focusing on how the map behaves in response to user actions and data changes. Specifically, I\'m ensuring the view centers on the user\'s pickup point when the map loads or when pickup coordinates are updated. Also, in the `LeafletMap.tsx` component, I\'m working out the logic for fitting the map bounds to the route polyline, which requires a check for the route\'s point count.\n\n\n**Refining Location Logic**\n\nI\'m now refining the map\'s centering logic. If an ambulance is active and its ID is assigned, or the booking stage is not in a pending search phase, the map now smartly centers on the pickup coordinates. The zoom level is carefully set to ensure the pickup pin and accuracy circle are clearly visible. I\'ve also integrated considerations for cases where location data is unavailable.\n\n\n**Verifying Feature Integration**\n\nNow, I\'m verifying the successful integration of key features. The goal is that, following operator acceptance, the map clearly displays both the assigned ambulance and its route. As the trip advances, the system should dynamically update both the route and the vehicle\'s position on the map. I\'m focusing on ensuring consistent map behavior across all booking methods.\n\n\n**Fixing Initial State**\n\nI\'ve pinpointed an issue in how the application initializes. The homepage was displaying as if an active booking existed. My focus shifted to the initial state; it seems the default booking was active. The problem was the `[INITIAL_DEMO_BOOKING]` in `App.tsx` and `server.ts`. I\'m correcting the initial state to ensure a clean load.\n\n\n**Clarifying Null State Display**\n\nI\'m now clarifying the application\'s behavior when no active booking exists. Specifically, I\'m verifying the display on a fresh visit or reset, where the `bookings` array should be empty and `activeBooking` null. I want to ensure the homepage correctly presents the clean ambulance booking interface, without any map, and showing the core user interface elements like the emergency dispatch tabs, \"Hold to Confirm\" button, GPS status, and manual booking options.\n\n\n"
