  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Addressing the DropAid Bug**\n\nI\'m currently focused on pinpointing the ambulance route transition bug in DropAid, specifically the issue where the map doesn\'t update to show the new route after patient pick-up. I\'m exploring the codebase to isolate the source, suspecting a disconnect between the route data and the map\'s display logic, all while keeping the existing app intact.\n\n\n**Implementing the Routing Update**\n\nI\'ve got a plan to address the route display discrepancy after patient pick-up. My focus now is on implementing a fresh hospital route when the status hits \"Patient Picked Up.\" It involves removing the old route, requesting a new one based on the current ambulance position, and ensuring the UI, including the map, updates smoothly with the new destination, ETA, and navigation data. I\'m also planning to incorporate animation. Furthermore, I will prevent stale data issues and handle routing failures gracefully. Quality control, including end-to-end flow testing, will be critical.\n\n\n"
