    thinking: "**Examining Route Data**\n\nI\'ve been looking closely at the `UserDashboard.tsx` file, specifically line 307. I noticed how `activeBooking.routePolyline` is handled. The route is set when the booking is accepted, marking the initial ambulance-to-pickup phase. The code elegantly manages the initial route assignment.\n\n\n**Analyzing Route Assignment**\n\nI\'ve now moved on to the `handleAdvanceStage` function, specifically the logic for the \"transporting\" stage. I see the system attempts to fetch the hospital route using `getDrivingRoute`. However, I\'m concerned about the state update. The polyline is set locally with `setRoutePolyline`, but it appears `setBookings` doesn\'t update the booking\'s `routePolyline` within the main `bookings` state. This omission warrants further investigation.\n\n\n"
