  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Requirements Thoroughly**\n\nOkay, I\'m carefully reviewing the problem statement. The core issue seems to be a bug in the ambulance route transition within DropAid. The key constraint is to fix it without a full rebuild or design changes, meaning I\'ll need to focus on existing code. I\'m focusing on identifying the exact location of the bug within the ambulance\'s route transition logic.\n\n\n**Defining the Scope**\n\nI\'ve scoped the necessary fix. Upon \"Patient Picked Up\" status, I\'ll remove the pickup route and request a hospital route, updating all relevant UI elements. Animation using road coordinates is crucial, and synchronization between views is required. I\'ll need to address race conditions and implement error handling for failed routing requests. Finally, I\'ll need to test the entire flow to confirm the fix.\n\n\n"
