  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Route Generation**\n\nI\'m currently focused on `getDrivingRoute` and how it handles fetching driving routes using OSRM. I see that it returns polyline data, distance, estimated time, and the route provider, with a fallback to `generateRealisticRoadRoute` if OSRM is unavailable or slow. I\'m also considering OSRM\'s ability to sometimes provide navigation turns.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
