  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Route Logic**\n\nI\'ve been examining line 307. I\'ve realized `activeBooking.routePolyline` is, at times, an empty array, which is still truthy in JavaScript! This means that `routePolyline` is assigned even when it is empty. Further, I observe it will be populated with `phase1Polyline` later on. The null coalescing operator will likely cause a side effect.\n\n\n"
