  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Analyzing Transportation Phase**\n\nI\'m currently focusing on the transition to the \"transporting\" stage, specifically lines 281-295. I\'m calculating the Phase 2 route, which is the pickup to hospital dropoff route. It\'s using getDrivingRoute with the current bookings. I\'m trying to see if there are any issues with this step.\n\n\n**Refining Route Calculations**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the route calculation and rendering, specifically the implications of `setRoutePolyline` being called before the driving route has completed. I\'m also examining the lack of immediate reset of `waypointIndexRef.current` and its potential impact on the animation. Finally, I noticed `setBookings` doesn\'t update booking route data, and I need to verify origin of the route in `getDrivingRoute`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_2614"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Support persisting routePolyline, distanceKm, and etaMinutes on booking stage update\", \"EndLine\":211, \"Instruction\":\"Update /api/bookings/:id/stage to update routePolyline, distanceKm, etaMinutes, and assignedUnitId\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"// Update booking stage\\napp.post(\'/api/bookings/:id/stage\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { id } = req.params;\\n  const { stage, assignedUnitId, routePolyline, distanceKm, etaMinutes } = req.body;\\n\\n  let found = false;\\n  serverBookings = serverBookings.map((b) => {\\n    if (b.id === id) {\\n      found = true;\\n      const updated = {\\n        ...b,\\n        stage,\\n        ...(assignedUnitId ? { assignedUnitId } : {}),\\n        ...(Array.isArray(routePolyline) ? { routePolyline } : {}),\\n        ...(typeof distanceKm === \'number\' ? { distanceKm } : {}),\\n        ...(typeof etaMinutes === \'number\' ? { etaMinutes } : {}),\\n      };\\n      return updated;\\n    }\\n    return b;\\n  });\\n\\n  if (!found) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Booking not found\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  // If completed or cancelled, return vehicle to base and free the vehicle\\n  if (stage === \'completed\' || stage === \'cancelled\') {\\n    const bk = serverBookings.find((b) => b.id === id);\\n    if (bk && bk.assignedUnitId) {\\n      serverAmbulances = serverAmbulances.map((a) =>\\n        a.id === bk.assignedUnitId\\n          ? {\\n              ...a,\\n              location: { ...a.baseLocation },\\n              status: \'available\' as const,\\n              currentBookingId: undefined,\\n              speedKmH: 0,\\n            }\\n          : a\\n      );\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  res.json({ success: true, stage });\\n});\", \"StartLine\":173, \"TargetContent\":\"// Update booking stage\\napp.post(\'/api/bookings/:id/stage\', (req: Request, res: Response) => {\\n  const { id } = req.params;\\n  const { stage } = req.body;\\n\\n  let found = false;\\n  serverBookings = serverBookings.map((b) => {\\n    if (b.id === id) {\\n      found = true;\\n      const updated = { ...b, stage };\\n      return updated;\\n    }\\n    return b;\\n  });\\n\\n  if (!found) {\\n    return res.status(404).json({ error: \'Booking not found\' });\\n  }\\n\\n  // If completed or cancelled, return vehicle to base and free the vehicle\\n  if (stage === \'completed\' || stage === \'cancelled\') {\\n    const bk = serverBookings.find((b) => b.id === id);\\n    if (bk && bk.assignedUnitId) {\\n      serverAmbulances = serverAmbulances.map((a) =>\\n        a.id === bk.assignedUnitId\\n          ? {\\n              ...a,\\n              location: { ...a.baseLocation },\\n              status: \'available\' as const,\\n              currentBookingId: undefined,\\n              speedKmH: 0,\\n            }\\n          : a\\n      );\\n    }\\n  }\\n\\n  res.json({ success: true, stage });\\n});\", \"TargetFile\":\"/server.ts\", \"toolAction\":\"Updating stage endpoint in server.ts\", \"toolSummary\":\"Update stage endpoint in server.ts\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\214\021\n\211\021\001i\024}\023T\251\350\003M\242\200|\254\022+\323\027\303<j\271\260n\342\362R}\354\027\336\206\275({\357\262t\2172\350\244\341\362\"o\037\366:\343\275\332z\215\267\vM\375p\257\350\356J\t\022\253\300\366\273\370p=\004\230\315Q=\307\234\023\251\312\222r\357\241\v\320\252\211}J}\275\000\204v\332\272gH \204w\317Ur\037\216J$E\254l\001\031\373*]\025E\0306\027\207\3238\324i\363\a\000\301\036o\222A\246MM!\205\b\303\200@\345,\3659\331\003~\347*\370\303\213t\373\n(\252U\215\252]\272\247\263\316\301\374R\nW\200\272,9\030\021\022\355\2358\355\360x\n\244\032Oe\355\352Yr\276GuU\032M\367\346qjM\307\324,\026A\237\n\375\245\271\240\274\267\265\004\255\025\250\310B6\323\224\327\306\t\362x\300\002i\344\302\262a\'\266\226M\374<4O\312/\241\021si\354\361^\200\254\220\355\0343\353\030\242\315\266\023t9\253\367MCe1\300\302\336\b)\310,BU\242\020\331\343\347i\024d\231\261:*\235\324\265\216\345\210\325\221;\337Q\334\233\270`\352\204\334\216\366\b\361\324#\357\036$Y\347\3140#\024\306\246\243\223\000\033.\337\177q##\374\340\a`\000\207\227\002\213`n\'\2747_X\264\004*\265v\304\314\316\266\345:\177D\375\234&\365\266\201\364_\n\017l\366\243\005\305\346:\341\216\240\036Y \262b\005\325X\003\3126\016\tq7\355\262\351\035/\2320D\353\313\3372\232\a_\316\377\315\036J\016=\036\321\001\302:\347\340\316Z\230m\275\271\373\310K\343\f\315\247\020\233|\267?\004&\206>`\317\257\261\257\022\036\204\254\324\332C3\262#\f\237\n\302^\301\326\244\030\261g\234\302oP\037\321\v\365\210\231\371\316/\27423\333\347H\006\236\377\226(H\311$\206\327\267\2216\245\234(B\211i\226[JP\322:v\350vp\034\312\275$\274\333r\n\364\000\023#But\202\346\244=\374\341W\260i\200_W\023\307\263\325N\354\b,\313\264\267\341\"\230]Z\232\033\361\377}\"\t\224S!\021L\275@^\251\304\227\244\340\327\232\022\265\376=p\346\321\206u\333q\273\026\246\2243\202}\036\242\361\303\262\353&\205`(\230r\347\320M\0027F \2217\"\361\275\317\020\006\352\n\f}\004y\002A\330\260\020b\221\316\371\306\326\304\364\311F\342\032/\3