  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reviewing Route Transition**\n\nOkay, here\'s the current thinking: When advancing to the \"transporting\" stage, I need to clear the route polyline right away with `setRoutePolyline([])`. Immediately after that, I\'ll reset the waypoint index to zero using `waypointIndexRef.current = 0`. I will also clear any previous route errors with `setRouteError(null)`. Then, I\'ll update the ambulance state to reflect \"transporting\".\n\n\n**Refining Route Logic**\n\nI\'m now focusing on refining the route logic when the booking stage transitions to \"transporting\". I\'ve decided to immediately request a new route from the current location to the hospital coordinates, guarding against stale requests. Upon success, I\'ll update the route polyline, distance, ETA, and waypoint index, then update the booking details in the state and the server. I\'ll also handle errors robustly by clearing the route polyline and displaying an error message. I\'m also planning the retrial logic if an error occurs.\n\n\n**Updating Route Calculations**\n\nI\'m now implementing dynamic route recalculation. When the stage is \"en_route_pickup\", I\'ll recalculate the route to the pickup location. Otherwise, I\'ll recalculate from the pickup to the dropoff. To manage requests, I\'m adding `routingRequestIdRef` and `isSubmitting` to avoid stale calculations. I\'ve added error handling to catch route calculation failures.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_489147"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add routingRequestIdRef and guard calculateCurrentRoute against race conditions\", \"EndLine\":133, \"Instruction\":\"Add routingRequestIdRef and update calculateCurrentRoute\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  const [gpsError, setGpsError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const isSubmittingRef = useRef<boolean>(false);\\n  const routingRequestIdRef = useRef<number>(0);\\n  const [isSubmitting, setIsSubmitting] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n\\n  // 4. Modals State\\n  const [is3DViewerOpen, setIs3DViewerOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [isUploadModalOpen, setIsUploadModalOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [uploadCategory, setUploadCategory] = useState<\'id_card\' | \'insurance\' | \'medical_history\' | \'incident_photo\'>(\'insurance\');\\n  const [toastMessage, setToastMessage] = useState<{ type: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\'; text: string } | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Active Booking\\n  const activeBooking = bookings.find(\\n    (b) => b.stage !== \'completed\' && b.stage !== \'cancelled\'\\n  ) || null;\\n\\n  const assignedAmbulance = activeBooking?.assignedUnitId\\n    ? ambulances.find((a) => a.id === activeBooking.assignedUnitId) || null\\n    : null;\\n\\n  // Persist State to LocalStorage\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_bookings\', JSON.stringify(bookings));\\n  }, [bookings]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_ambulances\', JSON.stringify(ambulances));\\n  }, [ambulances]);\\n\\n  // Toast Helper\\n  const showToast = (text: string, type: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\' = \'info\') => {\\n    setToastMessage({ text, type });\\n    setTimeout(() => setToastMessage(null), 3800);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Recalculate Route whenever pickup or dropoff changes (only when no active trip is running)\\n  const calculateCurrentRoute = useCallback(async (start: LatLng, end: LatLng) => {\\n    setRouteError(null);\\n    const reqId = ++routingRequestIdRef.current;\\n    try {\\n      const result = await getDrivingRoute(start, end);\\n      if (reqId !== routingRequestIdRef.current) return;\\n      setRoutePolyline(result.polyline);\\n      setRouteDistanceKm(result.distanceKm);\\n      setRouteEtaMins(result.etaMinutes);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      if (reqId === routingRequestIdRef.current) {\\n        console.warn(\'Failed to calculate route:\', err);\\n        setRouteError(\'Route service calculating road grid path.\');\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }, []);\", \"StartLine\":80, \"TargetContent\":\"  const [gpsError, setGpsError] = useState<string | null>(null);\\n  const isSubmittingRef = useRef<boolean>(false);\\n  const [isSubmitting, setIsSubmitting] = useState<boolean>(false);\\n\\n  // 4. Modals State\\n  const [is3DViewerOpen, setIs3DViewerOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [isUploadModalOpen, setIsUploadModalOpen] = useState(false);\\n  const [uploadCategory, setUploadCategory] = useState<\'id_card\' | \'insurance\' | \'medical_history\' | \'incident_photo\'>(\'insurance\');\\n  const [toastMessage, setToastMessage] = useState<{ type: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\'; text: string } | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Active Booking\\n  const activeBooking = bookings.find(\\n    (b) => b.stage !== \'completed\' && b.stage !== \'cancelled\'\\n  ) || null;\\n\\n  const assignedAmbulance = activeBooking?.assignedUnitId\\n    ? ambulances.find((a) => a.id === activeBooking.assignedUnitId) || null\\n    : null;\\n\\n  // Persist State to LocalStorage\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_bookings\', JSON.stringify(bookings));\\n  }, [bookings]);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_ambulances\', JSON.stringify(ambulances));\\n  }, [ambulances]);\\n\\n  // Toast Helper\\n  const showToast = (text: string, type: \'success\' | \'info\' | \'error\' = \'info\') => {\\n    setToastMessage({ text, type });\\n    setTimeout(() => setToastMessage(null), 3800);\\n  };\\n\\n  // Recalculate Route whenever pickup or dropoff changes (only when no active trip is running)\\n  const calculateCurrentRoute = useCallback(async (start: LatLng, end: LatLng) => {\\n    setRouteError(null);\\n    try {\\n      const result = await getDrivingRoute(start, end);\\n      setRoutePolyline(result.polyline);\\n      setRouteDistanceKm(result.distanceKm);\\n      setRouteEtaMins(result.etaMinutes);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      console.warn(\'Failed to calculate route:\', err);\\n      setRouteError(\'Route service calculating road grid path.\');\\n    }\\n  }, []);\", \"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\", \"toolAction\":\"Adding routingRequestIdRef in App.tsx\", \"toolSummary\":\"Add routingRequestIdRef in App.tsx\"}"
      thinking_signature: "\022\203\030\n\200\030\001i\024}\023\003t\300\204[\005\035\377\361\355\3641\326qU\023\251\2278\025g*\330\320`\325\213|\025\352=x&\215N\357\035\255\003\002\216(,\316\250\231\241d\334\212t\235\253B\"D\224p\307f\003]H\234\334t\360\b\bP\351\rX\002\323\341\251`\"\327A\323\302\205\233\f\245:[\246\022\006\340<\215\263\002\370\256\371\243=\325~\373\340t\263R?/\316\215/\005\201I9f\216\272>s?7F\231^\265\204\352\364h\v\375m\242\252; \306)X\250\266\254F\222!\356\242@=\300\211\222\344`\222\320V\\s\363\201@n\257\371\265\323\025B`R!3\005\273\'+X\340O\306\213H\261}\263\311\232\212\364y\n\305~\023\365}\325\324\245\312\220\232\253\2753\037&5\026\234\224\302\252\210\322\233K\367\372\211\363\325\216A\353fp\300K|\261\025t\322\320*{\217\037\3669\201zK?.\316o\002\220\205\003\273\354\v~\305\003/\034\2454\245@\254\310\214\374r\214\303\310\231~:\177\301\334/\315\360N\263:U,\275\030u\0052\344\025U\rg\346\265R\3174n\270>vX\006\017\264\005Bn\352\343\026\311\016\006`\340\345\253Jv\230\242\177\365O\305\346\031G>\257\231z\242!\335\341\222\3753V\006Nf\210*Z\360\205\177\0371%\253o\307\264\331\300\'\232\376pc\332\207)\202\2063\247P^\265h9\213954V\200}2\252\335+{\207\376h\016\3338\370\207\322k\3408Q>\367\241O\rN\023\031Sq\245\216\361\024\302C\017\220\024\r)\323\'p(\250\275k\005>a\202}l\b\324\264\305\306\253\215\206\274\t\247n\253^S1`\225\364\216\254\252\210\346\245aq\275z\207;\305s\003\017\353S\207\324L\030cpjuG5\366\372\035\020\335\312\366`\222v3=s\003)j\336f.\206\361p\rN\220\020\331&\372\324?\346y\334\322\330\207\027\033\322N\306\317\204\003O\255\266\23392\250z\271ST\316\334\233\333JQ\341\266\222)\030/k\303`,Y\334\340\027?m\034\212\337\324\273\353\241\034\241\'^\216\2644\331\207Nni\376\032\357\351\f\252\261\020\221\177\223\210\361\005\246\361\201,\333\322o\035\366\362cf\362\"Xb]<\346\006\214\246nd\257<\000\240\tP}\3721\f\343b\366\225U1ok*\245*+m\'\214\305X\206\036\207r\320\2551G\354E\301\370J\251\372\247o5\031\372X\271:\2232\304Y\364\312Q\316\'P\377\237\216,s\347u\021\016b