  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Examining Component Behavior**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `UserDashboard.tsx` component, specifically lines 108-124. My attention is drawn to the `useEffect` hook. I see an auto-connect to a countdown dispatch occurring when `activeBooking` is in the \'pending\' stage. The countdown is set to six seconds. I want to understand how this function works in relation to other active hooks and features.\n\n\n**Isolating User Controls**\n\nI\'ve made a crucial shift in focus, and realized I need to remove some functionality. The \"Accept Dispatch\" simulation and other operator-specific controls are being pulled from the `UserDashboard.tsx` component. The auto-accept countdown needs to go as well. The goal is to ensure a clean separation between user and operator features.\n\n\n"
