  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining Component Interactions**\n\nI\'ve been working on a component in `UserDashboard.tsx`, specifically lines 230-294. I\'m updating it to implement a `share` button using a modal. The modal will be triggered by an `onClick` event, improving user interaction flow. The button\'s styling will be inline and flexible. This update provides direct actions for the user.\n\n\n**Analyzing Button Behaviors**\n\nI am now focusing on the button components within `UserDashboard.tsx`, specifically those related to sharing and canceling bookings (lines 300-305). I\'m examining how to handle the button states, with an emphasis on incorporating conditional rendering to manage button visibility and interactivity based on the booking\'s stage. The conditional logic\'s goal is to ensure only eligible bookings can be canceled, and only before the driver has begun the trip.\n\n\n**Evaluating Booking Stages**\n\nI\'m now focusing on incorporating dynamic status banners. I am adding a conditional element within `UserDashboard.tsx` to display a status banner based on the `activeBooking.stage`. The logic aims to show a specific message if the stage is \'pending\'. The goal is to provide real-time updates on the booking\'s status, specifically indicating when the booking is in a pending state with the new UI.\n\n\n**Implementing Real-time Updates**\n\nI\'m now integrating a dynamic display within the UI to reflect real-time updates on ambulance searches. I\'ve added elements to show active search status and dispatch awaiting information, adding text and animated icons. The goal is to provide immediate feedback to the user regarding the progress of locating an ambulance. Also, I\'m passing a `isLocked={true}` prop to the `LeafletMap` component, likely to restrict user interaction with the map during this phase.\n\n\n**Securing Map Interaction**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the `LeafletMap` component within `UserDashboard.tsx`. I\'ve ensured map interaction is locked by setting `isLocked={true}` while the booking is pending. I\'ve also incorporated `onPickupChange` and `onDropoffChange` as empty functions, preventing any accidental location changes from the user panel during this crucial stage.\n\n\n"
