e data flow related to booking history and the `handleCancelActiveBooking` function. The goal is to fully understand how cancellations are managed. I am now looking at the `onSubmitBooking` function.\n\n\n**Examining Live Dispatch Map**\n\nI\'m now diving into the `OperatorLiveDispatch` component within `App.tsx`. I\'m closely scrutinizing how the map renders, particularly the interaction of `pickupCoords`, `dropoffCoords`, and `ambulances`. I\'m focusing on the `LeafletMap` props, specifically how the rerouting polyline is updated. The goal is to ensure the map\'s visual representation of ambulance routes is accurate and responsive to operator rerouting actions.\n\n\n**Confirming File Edits**\n\nI\'ve just verified that the `Hospital` type is correctly imported from `./types/index.ts` within `src/App.tsx`. I am confident that the `replace_file_content` operation was executed successfully. This ensures that the type is accessible where needed. I\'m now reviewing how the component uses this to pass the information correctly to the child components.\n\n\n"
