  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Refining User Access**\n\nI\'ve successfully separated user and operator controls. Operator-specific tools like time skip, auto-accept countdown, simulation stage buttons, manual status controls, and reset controls are now exclusively in the Operator Panel. The User Panel is streamlined, focusing solely on user-relevant actions. I am now proceeding with the remaining requirements.\n\n\n**Implementing Location Locking**\n\nI\'ve recently locked down pickup and destination locations in the User Panel after booking confirmation, preventing user edits. This is accomplished through read-only summary cards, a disabled LeafletMap, and locked location selection buttons. Location changes are now exclusively handled via operator rerouting, which includes route recalculation, ETA updates, backend syncing, and immediate cross-view reflection.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_428217"
