    thinking: "**Initiating Skill Check**\n\nI\'m currently focused on analyzing the user\'s request to identify the appropriate skill for this task. I\'m reviewing the available skills, which include various options like applet-seo, cloudsql-execute-sql, firebase-integration-rpc, and several others. The initial scan aims to determine the optimal skill to apply.\n\n\n**Defining Relevant Skills**\n\nI\'ve moved on to defining the skills needed to fulfill the request. I\'m focusing on \"real-time-and-multi-user\" capabilities for the dashboard, \"google-maps-platform-ghp-integration\" for the fleet map and location services, and \"planning-mode\" for automated dispatch. I\'ll need to integrate \"gemini-interactions-api\" for any potential conversational UI. The daily ride simulation will need specific attention.\n\n\n**Refining Simulation Details**\n\nI\'m now refining the ride simulation. I\'m focusing on incorporating realistic delays and randomizing aspects like pickup locations, destinations (including hospitals), and ambulance availability. I\'m also planning to store ride data with unique IDs and comprehensive timestamps. The operator dashboard will display ride states, and I\'ll implement simulation controls.\n\n\n"
