  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing User Profiles**\n\nI\'m focusing now on enabling user profile management within DropAid. I\'m structuring the implementation to provide intuitive profile viewing and editing. The goal is a seamless user experience, allowing individuals to effortlessly update their personal information \342\200\223 name, contact details, and any other relevant profile data. The next step is data security, making sure user data is safe.\n\n\n**Enhancing Profile Features**\n\nI\'m now integrating crucial user profile details: emergency contacts (name, relationship, phone, blood type, allergies, medical info, and insurance). A \"My Profile\" page is planned for navigation. I\'m focusing on data persistence via database (`GET /api/profile`, `POST /api/profile`) and `localStorage`, aiming for secure Cloudinary integration for photos, with validation. I\'m also planning to remove the Simulation Card.\n\n\n**Orchestrating Ambulance Movement**\n\nI\'m now focusing on automating ambulance dispatch and movement. I\'m prioritizing realistic movement with configurable speeds, updating markers on both dashboards with position, heading, ETA, and trip status. I\'m focusing on ensuring data synchronization. After pickup, I will recalculate routes. The aim is stopping movement upon trip completion or cancellation. I\'m also eliminating the manual simulation start, ensuring the app is ready for bookings. The goal is automatic ambulance assignment to valid bookings within a 5-second timeframe.\n\n\n"
