  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Automatic Dispatch**\n\nI\'m focusing on the `UserDashboard.tsx` component, specifically when a booking is pending. I\'m exploring how to handle the message when no ambulance is assigned or available. Requirement 4, which mentions automatic dispatch, needs to be integrated here.\n\n\n**Implementing Automatic Dispatch**\n\nI\'ve been working on integrating automatic dispatch. Within `UserDashboard.tsx`, I\'m handling the \'pending\' booking stage. If `assignedUnitId` is absent, I\'ll display a message. I\'m implementing a proximity matching system. If an ambulance is available, it\'ll show a \"Matching\" message with a countdown. Otherwise, it will show a more urgent message that includes the phrase \"All 14 emergency fleet units are currently deployed.\"\n\n\n"
