  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Integrating Profile Logic**\n\nI\'m currently focused on integrating the `UserProfileView` component into `src/App.tsx`. I\'m working on conditional rendering based on the `currentView` state, so the profile view appears correctly. I\'m also implementing the profile data loading from the `/api/profile` endpoint on component mount and ensuring data persistence through the `handleSaveProfile` function, updating the server and `localStorage`.\n\n\n**Orchestrating Ambulance Movement**\n\nI\'ve crafted an engine to simulate ambulance movement along routes. It uses a dedicated timer, `movementIntervalRef`, and iterates through active trips, updating ambulance location, heading, and speed, and synchronizing these updates across dashboards. The engine manages route transitions: pickup to scene, scene to transport, and transport to hospital, using a single interval to prevent stale routes and duplicate timers. Stops are triggered upon trip completion or cancellation.\n\n\n"
