  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adjusting Transport Logic**\n\nI\'ve been refining the logic for the \'transporting\' stage. Specifically, I\'m ensuring the `currentWaypointIndex` resets to 0 whenever a booking transitions to this stage. This will ensure that the transportation process correctly starts at the beginning of the designated hospital route, which is crucial for accurate navigation.\n\n\n**Refining Stage Transitions**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the transitions between stages, particularly how the `currentWaypointIndex`, `distanceKm`, and `etaMinutes` are updated as a booking progresses. I\'ve confirmed that the waypoint index resets to 0 when transitioning to \'transporting\'. I also plan to finalize the handling of the route polyline during stage changes and ensure that the ambulance\'s status and location are updated when transitioning to stages like \'completed\' and \'cancelled\', and that its values are correct.\n\n\n**Evaluating View Transitions**\n\nI\'m now examining how the UI changes based on user interactions and booking states. I\'m focusing on the transitions between the \'profile\', \'hospitals\', and \'user\' views. I\'m ensuring smooth data flow, particularly the `dropoff` and hospital data, to prevent any UI inconsistencies. I am also making sure the toast messages are displayed correctly.\n\n\n**Analyzing Booking Submission**\n\nI\'m now deep-diving into the booking submission process. I\'m focusing on ensuring data consistency between the `pickup` and `dropoff` locations, and I\'m integrating the `onPickupChange`, `onDropoffChange`, and `handleDetectGPS` functions correctly. My primary goal is to make sure that the `activeBooking` and `bookingHistory` are populated and maintained accurately after submission. I\'m also ensuring the ambulance and patient information are passed correctly.\n\n\n**Examining UI State Logic**\n\nI\'m now deeply engaged in refining the conditional rendering within the main component. I\'m focusing on the correct display of either the `BookingSubmissionView` or the `OperatorDashboard` based on the `isSubmitting` state. I\'m ensuring smooth transitions between the two views and proper handling of all the props passed down to each, including retry dispatch, countdown timer, booking data, ambulance info, and simulation controls. I am working to make sure that the dashboard has access to all booking and ambulance data.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_775774"
      name: "replace_file_content"
      arguments_json: "{\"AllowMultiple\":false, \"Description\":\"Add profile sync, profile fetching, and routePolyline synchronization in App.tsx\", \"EndLine\":205, \"Instruction\":\"Update fetchSync to handle profile, add fetchProfile on mount, handleSaveProfile, and sync routePolyline with activeBooking\", \"ReplacementContent\":\"  // Sync with Server (simulation state, bookings, fleet, hospitals, and profile)\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const fetchSync = async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const res = await fetch(\'/api/sync\');\\n        if (!res.ok) return;\\n        const data = await res.json();\\n\\n        if (data.simulation) {\\n          setSimulationState(data.simulation);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.bookings)) {\\n          setBookings(data.bookings);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.ambulances) && data.ambulances.length > 0) {\\n          setAmbulances(data.ambulances);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.hospitals) && data.hospitals.length > 0) {\\n          setHospitals(data.hospitals);\\n        }\\n        if (data.profile) {\\n          setPatientProfile((prev) => ({ ...prev, ...data.profile }));\\n        }\\n      } catch {\\n        // silent sync\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    fetchSync();\\n    const timer = setInterval(fetchSync, 2500);\\n    return () => clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Fetch initial profile from server on mount\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const fetchProfile = async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const res = await fetch(\'/api/profile\');\\n        if (res.ok) {\\n          const data = await res.json();\\n          if (data.profile) {\\n            setPatientProfile(data.profile);\\n            localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_patient_profile\', JSON.stringify(data.profile));\\n          }\\n        }\\n      } catch (err) {\\n        console.warn(\'Profile fetch error, using local fallback:\', err);\\n      }\\n    };\\n    fetchProfile();\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Save profile changes (persisted in database & localStorage)\\n  const handleSaveProfile = async (updated: PatientProfile) => {\\n    setPatientProfile(updated);\\n    localStorage.setItem(\'dropaid_patient_profile\', JSON.stringify(updated));\\n\\n    try {\\n      const res = await fetch(\'/api/profile\', {\\n        method: \'POST\',\\n        headers: { \'Content-Type\': \'application/json\' },\\n        body: JSON.stringify(updated),\\n      });\\n\\n      if (!res.ok) {\\n        throw new Error(\'Server returned error\');\\n      }\\n\\n      showToast(\'Profile and medical records saved to database!\', \'success\');\\n    } catch (err) {\\n      console.warn(\'Error saving profile to server:\', err);\\n      showToast(\'Profile saved in local storage (Server offline fallback).\', \'info\');\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  // Recalculate Route preview when no active booking is running\\n  const calculateCurrentRoute = useCallback(async (start: LatLng, end: LatLng) => {\\n    setRouteError(null);\\n    const reqId = ++routingRequestIdRef.current;\\n    try {\\n      const result = await getDrivingRoute(start, end);\\n      if (reqId !== routingRequestIdRef.current) return;\\n      setRoutePolyline(result.polyline);\\n      setRouteDistanceKm(result.distanceKm);\\n      setRouteEtaMins(result.etaMinutes);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      if (reqId === routingRequestIdRef.current) {\\n        console.warn(\'Failed to calculate route:\', err);\\n        setRouteError(\'Route service calculating road grid path.\');\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Automatically update preview route if no active booking\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!activeBooking) {\\n      calculateCurrentRoute(pickup.coords, dropoff.coords);\\n    } else if (activeBooking.routePolyline && activeBooking.routePolyline.length > 0) {\\n      setRoutePolyline(activeBooking.routePolyline);\\n      setRouteDistanceKm(activeBooking.distanceKm);\\n      setRouteEtaMins(activeBooking.etaMinutes);\\n    }\\n  }, [pickup.coords, dropoff.coords, activeBooking?.id, activeBooking?.stage, calculateCurrentRoute]);\", \"StartLine\":150, \"TargetContent\":\"  // Sync with Server (simulation state, bookings, fleet, and hospitals)\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const fetchSync = async () => {\\n      try {\\n        const res = await fetch(\'/api/sync\');\\n        if (!res.ok) return;\\n        const data = await res.json();\\n\\n        if (data.simulation) {\\n          setSimulationState(data.simulation);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.bookings)) {\\n          setBookings(data.bookings);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.ambulances) && data.ambulances.length > 0) {\\n          setAmbulances(data.ambulances);\\n        }\\n        if (Array.isArray(data.hospitals) && data.hospitals.length > 0) {\\n          setHospitals(data.hospitals);\\n        }\\n      } catch {\\n        // silent sync\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    fetchSync();\\n    const timer = setInterval(fetchSync, 2500);\\n    return () => clearInterval(timer);\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Recalculate Route preview when no active booking is running\\n  const calculateCurrentRoute = useCallback(async (start: LatLng, end: LatLng) => {\\n    setRouteError(null);\\n    const reqId = ++routingRequestIdRef.current;\\n    try {\\n      const result = await getDrivingRoute(start, end);\\n      if (reqId !== routingRequestIdRef.current) return;\\n      setRoutePolyline(result.polyline);\\n      setRouteDistanceKm(result.distanceKm);\\n      setRouteEtaMins(result.etaMinutes);\\n    } catch (err: any) {\\n      if (reqId === routingRequestIdRef.current) {\\n        console.warn(\'Failed to calculate route:\', err);\\n        setRouteError(\'Route service calculating road grid path.\');\\n      }\\n    }\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    if (!activeBooking) {\\n      calculateCurrentRoute(pickup.coords, dropoff.coords);\\n    }\\n  }, [pickup.coords, dropoff.coords, activeBooking, calculateCurrentRoute]);\", \"